      "text": "Block diagram decomposing SWOT: a single 'SWOT Analysis' box divides into 'Internal Factors — Strengths, Weaknesses' and 'External Factors — Opportunities, Threats'. This is the axis the method turns on: the first two are attributes of the organisation, the second two of its environment.",
